      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "intro",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero",
            "style": "min-height:auto; padding-top:60px;"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "hero-eyebrow"
              },
              "html": "Couples massage · Personalized audio · Adults 18+"
            },
            {
              "tag": "h1",
              "attrs": {
                "id": "page-title"
              },
              "html": "A sensual couples massage, <br>\n<em>guided by a voice.</em>\n"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-sub"
              },
              "html": "Want to share a moment of touch and attention without following a video? Choose duo mode and sensual massage among your preferences in Caresse. A synthetic voice accompanies a guided fiction created for the two of you."
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "store-controls"
              },
              "html": "\n<div class=\"cta-group\">\n<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US\" id=\"hero-cta\" class=\"cta-pink\" data-store-auto data-cta-position=\"hero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download now</a>\n</div>\n"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "hero-badge"
              },
              "html": "Free demos · No Caresse account · Personalized sessions with paid credits, no subscription."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "intent"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Stay with the moment, rather than reading the next step."
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "intent-prose"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "A couples massage is a moment of touch and shared attention. A calm atmosphere and gestures you choose together set the tone for your experience."
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Caresse brings a voice to this moment. Duo mode and your preferences shape a guided story, with your names or nicknames woven into the narration."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "diff"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title",
                "id": "configuration-title"
              },
              "html": "One possible starting configuration"
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "diff-table-wrap"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "table",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "diff-table",
                    "aria-labelledby": "configuration-title"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Participants</td>\n<td class=\"highlight\">Alex and Sam, or two nicknames</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mode</td>\n<td class=\"highlight\">Duo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Preference</td>\n<td class=\"highlight\">Sensual massage</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Intention</td>\n<td class=\"highlight\">A calm atmosphere and gentle intensity</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "intent-prose",
                "style": "max-width:900px;margin:32px auto 0;"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "For a first experience, start with an atmosphere you both enjoy. Duo mode, your chosen names and your selected preferences shape your session."
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "The voice can use your chosen names or nicknames in a generated narrative. Duration depends on the content created; you cannot set an exact number of minutes."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "how"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Prepare your massage experience in three steps"
            },
            {
              "type": "cards",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "steps-grid"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "step-item"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<div class=\"num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</div>\n<h3>Hear the voice first</h3>\n<p>Download the app and listen to a free demo. Demos introduce the format; they are not a massage session personalized with your names.</p>\n"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "step-item"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<div class=\"num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</div>\n<h3>Choose together</h3>\n<p>Select duo mode, enter the names you want to use and choose sensual massage. Review the mood, intensity and other options before continuing.</p>\n"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "step-item"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<div class=\"num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</div>\n<h3>Create, then listen</h3>\n<p>Generation uses a paid credit. Once the audio is ready, get comfortable and let the voice accompany your time together.</p>\n"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "benefits"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "A moment that feels like you"
            },
            {
              "type": "cards",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefits-grid"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "benefit-card"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<h3>Every couple is welcome</h3>\n<p>Caresse welcomes all adult couples, whatever each person’s gender or sexual orientation. Your shared interests shape the experience.</p>\n"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "benefit-card"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<h3>Your conversation still matters</h3>\n<p>Every touch and every activity require the free, mutual consent of everyone taking part. That agreement matters throughout your time together and can be withdrawn at any point.</p>\n"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "benefit-card"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<h3>Fiction, rather than professional training</h3>\n<p>Caresse creates an intimate narrative experience. It does not replace professional massage training or promise therapeutic results.</p>\n"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq",
            "aria-labelledby": "faq-title"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "id": "faq-title",
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Your questions, answered."
            },
            {
              "type": "faq",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-list"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Do we need massage skills to try it?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "You do not need prior experience to discover the format. Caresse offers an audio story built around sensual massage; it is not a massage training course."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Do we need to buy accessories?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "This setup requires no special accessories. Select app options that match what you have available and want to use together."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Is this a free massage demo?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "The app and demos are free to download and try, but a session created from your names and preferences uses a paid credit. Existing demos have fixed configurations and do not promise this particular scenario."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Do I need a Caresse account to buy credits?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "No. Anonymous mode lets you use Caresse without creating a Caresse account. Purchases still require your Apple or Google account and its payment method on the store you use."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Which audio languages are available?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Caresse generates audio sessions in French, English, Spanish and Portuguese. Demos are in French, English and Spanish. The Portuguese interface is available on Android; the iOS update is awaiting approval."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
